            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同期"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同步关闭时选项不可更改，已保存的偏好仍保留在本机。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These options cannot be changed while sync is off; saved preferences remain on this device."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同期がオフの間はこれらのオプションを変更できません。保存済みの設定はこのデバイスに保持されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同步内容": {
