    "请检查网络与文件夹状态后重试；本机数据与已缓存内容仍可离线使用。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check the network and folder, then try again. Local data and cached content remain available offline."
          }
